<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SocialFusion</title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/favicon-32x32.png" type="image/x-icon">
 
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-zinc-900 text-white leading-relaxed">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="bg-zinc-900 py-6 shadow-md">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <h1 class="text-white text-3xl font-bold">SocialFusion</h1>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <!-- About Us Section -->
        <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About SocialFusion</h2>
            <p class="text-lg mb-8">
                At SocialFusion, we are dedicated to revolutionizing the way people connect and interact online. Founded with the vision of creating a comprehensive and engaging social platform, our mission is to bring together diverse communities and foster meaningful relationships.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg mb-8">
                Our platform is designed to offer a seamless user experience with features that include personalized feeds, media sharing, and interactive tools. We believe in the power of connection and strive to make every interaction count, whether it's through sharing your latest update, connecting with friends, or discovering new content.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg mb-8">
                With a commitment to innovation and user satisfaction, SocialFusion is more than just a social media platform; it's a hub for creativity, engagement, and collaboration. We are passionate about providing a space where users can express themselves freely and connect with others who share their interests.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="bg-zinc-900 py-6 mt-12">
        <div class="container mx-auto text-center text-gray-400">
            <p>&copy; 2024 SocialFusion. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
